Subject: [PATCH] incus: Default the NBD listeners to a private unix socket
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This addresses GHSA-wm96-rxh7-f5w2 (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
